# Crypto data download (`mlbot data`)

Canonical: [`docs/usage.md`](../../docs/usage.md) · [`docs/lessons.md#features`](../../docs/lessons.md#features) · `mlbot data --help`

## Rule

1. Use `mlbot data download` / `convert` / `pipeline`, plus funding / open-interest subcommands.
2. Do not hand-roll `requests` to `fapi.binance.com/fapi/v1/klines` into `data/parquet_data`.
3. This extract runs locally. `--docker` is accepted and ignored.

```bash
mlbot data download --symbols BTCUSDT \
  --start-year 2026 --start-month 6 --end-year 2026 --end-month 6
mlbot data convert --symbols BTCUSDT
# or
mlbot data pipeline --symbols BTCUSDT
```

ZIP default: `data/agg_data/`. Parquet default: `data/parquet_data/`.

After new months, rebuild or incrementally backfill FeatureStore. Download alone is not enough for `event_backtest`.
